[274.054339, "o", "        \"answer\": \"Emtricitabine, rilpivirine, and tenofovir disoproxil fumarate tablets should be administered orally once daily with food. Prior to or when initiating treatment, patients should be tested for hepatitis B virus infection, and renal function (including serum creatinine, estimated creatinine clearance, urine glucose, and urine protein) should be assessed.\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
